Package: bourse
Title: Grounded Market-Data Connector for the ORCHESTRA Framework
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Max",
           family = "Moldovan",
           email = "max.moldovan@adelaide.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: Fetches historical and live market data (cryptocurrency OHLCV and related series) from public exchange APIs and emits it as a contract-typed, provenance-labelled series for the ORCHESTRA analytics framework. Every external fact -- a symbol, a price tick size, a fee schedule, a column unit -- is recorded in a provenance registry and treated as unverified until it has been diffed against the exchange own catalogue (the Independent Oracle Principle); an ungrounded fact triggers refusal rather than a silently wrong number.
